(   [Problem Statement]: Discuss the Outcome-Based Education \(OBE\) framework, Washington Accord, Program Outcomes \(POs\), and Bloom's Taxonomy in technical education.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Outcome-Based Education \(OBE\) in Technical Disciplines:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Paradigm Shift:) Tj
T*
(   Traditional education focused on input parameters \(hours lectured, syllabus covered\).) Tj
T*
(   Outcome-Based Education \(OBE\) focuses strictly on demonstrable student competencies and) Tj
T*
(   measurable graduate performance upon completion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Washington Accord & NBA:) Tj
T*
(   Signed in 1989, the Washington Accord is an international multilateral agreement among) Tj
T*
(   engineering accreditation bodies \(including ABET in the USA and the National Board of) Tj
T*
(   Accreditation - NBA in India\). It establishes substantial equivalence of undergraduate) Tj
T*
(   engineering programs, granting graduates international mobility and professional licensure) Tj
T*
(   eligibility across all member nations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Graduate Attributes & Program Outcomes \(POs\):) Tj
T*
(   The Washington Accord specifies 12 universal Program Outcomes: Engineering Knowledge, Problem) Tj
T*
(   Analysis, Design/Development of Solutions, Complex Problem Investigation, Modern Tool Usage,) Tj
T*
(   Engineer and Society, Environment and Sustainability, Ethics, Individual and Teamwork,) Tj
T*
(   Communication, Project Management, and Life-Long Learning.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Bloom's Revised Taxonomy Integration:) Tj
T*
(   Cognitive assessment is structured across 6 hierarchical levels: Level 1 \(Remembering\), Level 2) Tj
T*
(   \(Understanding\), Level 3 \(Applying\), Level 4 \(Analyzing\), Level 5 \(Evaluating\), and Level 6) Tj
T*
(   \(Creating\). Examination questions and project assessments are mapped to specific Bloom's levels) Tj
T*
(   to verify that engineering graduates cultivate deep analytical and synthesis skills.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
