(   Power-Angle Relationship and Transient Stability:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Consider a synchronous generator of terminal voltage $E \\angle \\delta$ connected to an infinite) Tj
T*
(   bus $V \\angle 0^\\circ$ through an equivalent transmission line reactance $X = X_d' + X_{line} +) Tj
T*
(   X_{tr}$:) Tj
T*
(   The complex power delivered to the infinite bus is:) Tj
T*
(   $$S = P + j Q = \\mathbf{V} \\mathbf{I}^* = V \\angle 0^\\circ \\left\( \\frac{E \\angle \\delta - V) Tj
T*
(   \\angle 0^\\circ}{j X} \\right\)^*$$) Tj
T*
(   Expanding the phasor algebra yields the classical Power-Angle equation:) Tj
T*
(   $$P = \\frac{E V}{X} \\sin\\delta = P_{max} \\sin\\delta$$) Tj
T*
(   where $\\delta$ is the rotor power angle \(rotor displacement relative to the synchronously) Tj
T*
(   rotating stator MMF\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Physical Mechanism of Transient Instability:) Tj
T*
(   During a 3-phase fault near the generator bus, terminal voltage collapses \($V \\approx 0$\),) Tj
T*
(   dropping electrical output power $P_e \\to 0$. However, mechanical turbine input power $P_m$) Tj
T*
(   cannot change instantaneously. By the Swing Equation \($M \\ddot{\\delta} = P_m - P_e$\), a massive) Tj
T*
(   net accelerating torque accelerates the rotor, causing $\\delta$ to surge.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Equal Area Criterion & Critical Clearing Time \(CCT\):) Tj
T*
(   Stability requires that the decelerating energy area after fault clearance \($A_{dec}$\) must) Tj
T*
(   exceed or equal the accelerating energy area during the fault \($A_{acc}$\). If the protective) Tj
T*
(   relay fails to clear the fault before the Critical Clearing Angle $\\delta_{cr}$, synchronism is) Tj
T*
(   irrevocably lost, tripping the generator.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Mitigation Measures: High-speed numerical relaying \(< 2 cycles\), fast static excitation systems) Tj
T*
(   with Power System Stabilizers \(PSS\), series capacitor compensation to decrease $X$, and) Tj
T*
(   single-pole auto-reclosing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
