12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Compare High-Voltage Direct Current \(HVDC\) transmission with Extra-High-Voltage AC \(EHVAC\), analyzing technical, economic, and operational break-even points.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Comparative Technical & Economic Analysis: HVDC vs. EHVAC:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Technical Advantages of HVDC:) Tj
T*
(   - Absence of Reactive Power Limitations: AC transmission is fundamentally limited by line) Tj
T*
(   capacitance charging current \($I_C = \\omega C V$\). Beyond ~50 km in underground/submarine) Tj
T*
(   cables, the cable capacitance completely absorbs the thermal current rating. DC has zero) Tj
T*
(   frequency \($\\omega = 0$\), eliminating reactive charging current.) Tj
T*
(   - Asynchronous Interconnection: HVDC links can connect two unsynchronized AC grids \(e.g., grids) Tj
T*
(   operating at different frequencies like 50 Hz and 60 Hz, or operating out of phase\), preventing) Tj
T*
(   cascading blackout propagation.) Tj
T*
(   - Right-of-Way \(RoW\) Efficiency: A bipolar HVDC transmission line requires only two conductors) Tj
T*
(   \(+/- poles\) on a single compact tower, whereas a double-circuit 3-phase HVAC line requires six) Tj
T*
(   bulky conductors, demanding significantly narrower land footprints.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Economic Cost Break-Even Distance:) Tj
T*
(   - Line Capital Cost: HVDC line construction is cheaper than HVAC because towers are lighter and) Tj
T*
(   fewer conductors are required.) Tj
T*
(   - Terminal Station Cost: HVDC requires massive Converter Stations \(rectifiers and inverters,) Tj
T*
(   harmonic filters, DC smoothing reactors\) at both ends, imposing a high initial capital) Tj
T*
(   expenditure.) Tj
T*
(   - Break-Even Distance:) Tj
T*
(   - For overhead transmission lines: Break-even distance is approximately 600 to 800 kilometers.) Tj
T*
(   - For submarine and underground cables: Break-even distance drops dramatically to roughly 40 to) Tj
T*
(   50 kilometers due to acute AC dielectric cable capacitance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
