BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the architecture of modern Substation Automation Systems \(SAS\) under the IEC 61850 standard, including Process, Bay, and Station bus levels.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   IEC 61850 Substation Automation System \(SAS\) Architecture:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   The IEC 61850 standard replaces miles of conventional copper hardwiring in substations with) Tj
T*
(   standardized high-speed optical Ethernet networks, partitioned into three functional tiers:) Tj
T*
() Tj
