(   1. Process Level:) Tj
T*
(   Comprises physical primary switchgear equipment: power transformers, circuit breakers,) Tj
T*
(   disconnectors, and instrument transformers. Non-conventional instrument transformers \(NCITs\)) Tj
T*
(   and Merging Units \(MUs\) digitize analog CT/PT waveforms into standardized digital Sampled) Tj
T*
(   Values \(SV, IEC 61850-9-2LE\) transmitted at 4000/4800 samples/sec over the Process Bus fiber) Tj
T*
(   network.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Bay Level:) Tj
T*
(   Houses Intelligent Electronic Devices \(IEDs\), protection relays, and bay controllers. IEDs) Tj
T*
(   receive digital SV streams over the Process Bus to execute differential, overcurrent, and) Tj
T*
(   distance protection algorithms. Between IEDs, ultra-high-speed Generic Object Oriented) Tj
T*
(   Substation Events \(GOOSE\) messages execute interlocking and breaker trip commands within) Tj
T*
(   sub-4-millisecond latency.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Station Level:) Tj
T*
(   Houses the Substation Host HMI, SCADA gateway, engineering workstations, and GPS) Tj
T*
(   time-synchronization clocks \(IEEE 1588 Precision Time Protocol\). The Station Bus \(IEC 61850-8-1) Tj
T*
(   MMS protocol\) connects Bay IEDs with the station gateway, routing telemetry and control) Tj
T*
(   commands to the National Load Dispatch Center.) Tj
T*
() Tj
