/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the phenomenon of Corona in EHV overhead lines: Peek's formula, power loss, and reduction methods.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Corona Discharge in Power Transmission:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Physical Mechanism:) Tj
T*
(   When the localized electric field intensity at the surface of an overhead conductor exceeds the) Tj
T*
(   dielectric breakdown strength of surrounding air \($g_0 = 30$ kV/cm peak, or $21.2$ kV/cm RMS in) Tj
T*
(   uniform air\), neutral air molecules undergo ionization, creating an envelope of ionized air) Tj
T*
(   accompanied by a violet glow, hissing noise, ozone \($O_3$\) production, and power loss.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
