(   2. Peek's Formula for Critical Disruptive Voltage:) Tj
T*
(   $$V_d = m_0 g_0 \\delta r \\ln\\left\( \\frac{D}{r} \\right\)$$) Tj
T*
(   where $m_0$ is conductor surface irregularity factor, $\\delta$ is air density correction) Tj
T*
(   factor, $r$ is conductor radius, and $D$ is inter-conductor spacing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Corona Reduction Techniques:) Tj
T*
(   - Increasing Conductor Radius: Using hollow conductors or steel-reinforced aluminum conductors.) Tj
T*
(   - Bundled Conductors: Grouping 2, 4, 6, or 8 sub-conductors per phase increases effective) Tj
T*
(   radius, drastically reducing electric field gradient at conductor surfaces.) Tj
