(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the working of a Modular Multilevel Converter \(MMC\) for Voltage Source Converter \(VSC\) HVDC systems.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Modular Multilevel Converter \(MMC\) Technology:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Architectural Overview:) Tj
T*
(   Unlike legacy two-level or three-level converters that generate high harmonic distortion, an) Tj
T*
(   MMC consists of six converter arms, each composed of hundreds of identical series-connected) Tj
T*
(   submodules \(half-bridge or full-bridge circuits\) and an arm reactor.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Stepped Waveform Synthesis:) Tj
T*
(   By dynamically inserting or bypassing submodules using high-speed IGBT switching, the MMC) Tj
T*
(   synthesizes a near-perfect sinusoidal voltage waveform with hundreds of discrete voltage steps.) Tj
T*
(   This eliminates bulky harmonic AC filters, reduces switching losses, and allows independent) Tj
T*
(   four-quadrant active and reactive power control with black-start capabilities.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
