(   [Problem Statement]: Discuss the operating principles of Automatic Generation Control \(AGC\) and Area Control Error \(ACE\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Automatic Generation Control \(AGC\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Area Control Error \(ACE\):) Tj
T*
(   In interconnected power pools, each control area must maintain its own generation-load balance) Tj
T*
(   and meet scheduled tie-line power exchange contracts:) Tj
T*
(   $$\\text{ACE} = \\Delta P_{tie} + B \\Delta f$$) Tj
T*
(   where $\\Delta P_{tie} = P_{tie,actual} - P_{tie,scheduled}$ and $B$ is the frequency bias) Tj
T*
(   factor \(MW/0.1 Hz\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Control Hierarchy:) Tj
T*
(   - Primary \(Governor Droop\): Responds in 2-10 seconds to arrest frequency deviation.) Tj
T*
(   - Secondary \(AGC Central Loop\): Calculates ACE every 2-4 seconds and sends raise/lower) Tj
T*
(   setpoints to participating generators via integral controllers, driving ACE and steady-state) Tj
T*
(   frequency error to zero.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 18:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the principles of Photovoltaic Maximum Power Point Tracking \(MPPT\) using Incremental Conductance algorithm.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Incremental Conductance MPPT Algorithm:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   The P-V curve of a solar array has a unique Maximum Power Point \(MPP\) where derivative) Tj
T*
(   $\\frac{dP}{dV} = 0$.) Tj
T*
(   Since $P = V \\cdot I$:) Tj
T*
(   $$\\frac{dP}{dV} = \\frac{d\(V I\)}{dV} = I + V \\frac{dI}{dV} = 0$$) Tj
T*
(   Dividing by $V$ yields the slope criterion:) Tj
T*
(   $$\\frac{dI}{dV} = -\\frac{I}{V}$$) Tj
T*
(   - At MPP: $\\frac{dI}{dV} = -\\frac{I}{V}$ \(Maintain operating voltage\).) Tj
T*
(   - Left of MPP: $\\frac{dI}{dV} > -\\frac{I}{V}$ \(Increase operating voltage\).) Tj
T*
(   - Right of MPP: $\\frac{dI}{dV} < -\\frac{I}{V}$ \(Decrease operating voltage\).) Tj
T*
(   Incremental Conductance eliminates steady-state oscillations around MPP and tracks rapid) Tj
T*
(   irradiance changes accurately.) Tj
T*
ET

