T*
(   Utility-Scale BESS Architecture:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Battery Racks & Strings: Composed of thousands of Lithium Iron Phosphate \($LiFePO_4$\) or NMC) Tj
T*
(   cells grouped into modules, managed by a distributed Battery Management System \(BMS\) monitoring) Tj
T*
