T*
(   the grid \(rectifier mode\) or discharge power to the grid \(inverter mode\) in milliseconds.) Tj
T*
(   3. Thermal & Fire Suppression System: Liquid cooling systems and aerosol fire suppression) Tj
T*
(   ensuring thermal runaway prevention.) Tj
T*
(   4. Energy Management System \(EMS\): High-level controller interfacing with SCADA to execute) Tj
T*
(   frequency regulation, peak shaving, and black-start commands.) Tj
