T*
() Tj
T*
(   A UPFC consists of two Voltage Source Converters \(VSCs\) sharing a common DC capacitor link:) Tj
T*
(   1. Shunt Converter \(STATCOM\): Injects controllable reactive power to regulate bus voltage and) Tj
